WEBVTT

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:52.280
Good.

00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:08.010
It's been a few days now

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:11.590
since my life of emptiness
turned into a life with my Cub.

00:01:13.140 --> 00:01:17.720
It feels like, little by little,
I'm growing accustomed to that change.

00:01:32.450 --> 00:01:35.070
I've gotten so I can do a number
of things with the Cub

00:01:35.070 --> 00:01:38.290
without having to think too hard about it.

00:01:44.210 --> 00:01:49.170
Still, there was another change
that was happening to me...

00:01:50.210 --> 00:01:51.720
Good morning.

00:01:52.630 --> 00:01:53.970
Mm-hmm.

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:04.980
...that I wasn't likely to get
accustomed to any time soon.

00:02:03.970 --> 00:02:09.020
Episode 3

00:02:03.970 --> 00:02:09.020
Super Cub

00:02:03.970 --> 00:02:09.020
Things Received

00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:41.990
Year

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:41.450
Yaguchi.

00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:41.910
Here.

00:03:41.910 --> 00:03:42.910
Yonemura.

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:43.570
Mukawa High School 2nd Year   Math II Quiz (Calculus

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:43.700
Here.

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:44.700
Watanabe.

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:45.910
Yo.

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:04.840
Chicken Curry

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:04.840
Chicken Curry

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:10.560
Okay, ready to go?

00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:16.780
I'm thinking of going out touring
during summer vacation, you know?

00:04:16.780 --> 00:04:22.030
As a bike enthusiast, I'd love to go see
the Suzuka 8 Hours. After that...

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:28.210
Is that cold curry any good?

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:46.850
After the 8 Hours, then what?

00:04:46.850 --> 00:04:52.230
Hmm? After that... I'm still
kind of thinking it through.

00:04:52.230 --> 00:04:55.610
But I'm thinking of doing something huge.

00:04:55.610 --> 00:04:57.070
Something huge?

00:04:57.070 --> 00:05:00.490
Yeah. If there's anything I need,
I can pack it in here.

00:05:00.490 --> 00:05:03.740
It's times like this when
I'm glad I bought a Cub.

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:05.580
That does seem handy.

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:07.580
Do you want a luggage box?

00:05:07.580 --> 00:05:08.950
Mm-hmm.

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:12.710
Hang on a second.

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:19.800
Oh, hello?

00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:22.380
Yes, the one I asked about before.

00:05:24.260 --> 00:05:27.390
Yes, if you wouldn't mind, please.

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:31.060
Let's make a stop on our
way home from school.

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:31.940
Huh?

00:05:31.940 --> 00:05:34.440
There's probably something
good in it for us.

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:52.580
All right, let's go!

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:53.370
Oh, hold on--

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:55.080
Hurry, hurry!

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:06.010
Sorry I walk so fast. It's a habit I have
from when I'm riding my Cub.

00:06:06.010 --> 00:06:08.970
I've tweaked my engine,
so if I don't ride the throttle wide open,

00:06:08.970 --> 00:06:11.020
I fall apart just like <i>that</i>.

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:16.020
"Super Ono"

00:06:18.110 --> 00:06:19.530
Welcome.

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:30.240
Let's see... This one...
and this one, maybe?

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:34.250
Here, buy these.

00:06:34.250 --> 00:06:35.500
Huh?

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:44.300
That will be 298 yen, please.
Do you need a bag?

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:45.680
Oh, no, I'm fine--

00:06:45.680 --> 00:06:47.050
A paper bag, please.

00:06:47.050 --> 00:06:49.600
Oh. Okay.

00:07:01.820 --> 00:07:03.400
Hello!

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:05.450
Oh, you're here.

00:07:05.450 --> 00:07:07.110
It's been a long time.

00:07:07.110 --> 00:07:09.580
I have it ready for you out back.

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:14.370
Here we are.

00:07:14.370 --> 00:07:16.710
My vendor has dibs on the frame,

00:07:16.710 --> 00:07:19.460
but if there's anything else you want,
you're free to pull it off of there.

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:20.920
Thanks.

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:26.930
Over 70,000 km on it...

00:07:28.970 --> 00:07:33.140
Oh, well that's no good. That's had it.

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:35.890
But as long as it has this...

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:37.270
Huh?

00:07:37.270 --> 00:07:40.480
Mister, can I borrow your tools?

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:42.150
You bet.

00:07:50.660 --> 00:07:53.080
Wanna take it off yourself?

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:54.450
Mm-hmm.

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:03.090
Hold it there. Hold the screwdriver
tight, then start turning.

00:08:03.090 --> 00:08:05.670
Keep the nut underneath
in place with the wrench.

00:08:25.110 --> 00:08:27.360
Okay, we'll take this, then.

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:28.860
Sure.

00:08:28.860 --> 00:08:34.200
But if you had called a little bit sooner,
I could have given you the frame, too.

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:41.670
Excuse me...

00:08:42.670 --> 00:08:44.920
Thank you very much.

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:49.590
I ride a Cub, as well, but I have
nothing to hold my things.

00:08:49.590 --> 00:08:55.310
Taking that handy box will be very helpful
to me. I'll take good care of it.

00:08:55.310 --> 00:09:00.440
So anyway, if you like, please take these
and share them with everyone.

00:09:00.440 --> 00:09:03.610
Huh? That's really not
what this was about...

00:09:03.610 --> 00:09:07.690
But if you're sure... then all right.

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:12.870
Okay, we'll be off now. Sorry to
interrupt you while you're working.

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:24.380
There.

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:38.470
You're grinning like a goofball.

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:42.640
Listen, thanks so much, really.
I never expected--

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:45.190
Oh, here you are.

00:09:45.190 --> 00:09:47.480
I hear you recently bought a Cub.

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:49.070
Sensei...

00:09:49.070 --> 00:09:52.820
This is the front basket
I used on my own Cub.

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:55.410
I don't need it anymore.
Would you like it?

00:09:55.410 --> 00:09:57.030
Take it!

00:10:14.260 --> 00:10:17.510
Parts come and parts go, see?

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:23.390
Whenever you need something,
if you call out to the universe,

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:26.690
those parts have a way of
swooping in from somewhere.

00:10:26.690 --> 00:10:28.070
Though most of the time,

00:10:28.070 --> 00:10:32.030
it happens after you've given up,
and you've already spent money on them.

00:10:32.030 --> 00:10:33.360
See you.

00:11:40.100 --> 00:11:41.890
The wind...

00:12:34.070 --> 00:12:37.070
I need to block the wind.

00:12:37.070 --> 00:12:39.450
If I cover this area...

00:12:39.450 --> 00:12:40.990
But...

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:46.290
Here, by any chance?

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:54.250
Inspected by: Honda
Manufacturing date

00:13:00.180 --> 00:13:03.010
"Saitama City, Omiya"...

00:13:06.390 --> 00:13:08.680
Saitama, huh?

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:27.240
They're going to tidy up the library.

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:28.320
{=1}Library construction notice

00:13:27.240 --> 00:13:28.620
Oh, yeah?

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:30.210
Good morning.

00:13:30.210 --> 00:13:31.540
Mm-hmm.

00:13:43.930 --> 00:13:46.930
The best part about having a Cub
with a black luggage box on it

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:49.730
is that you have anonymity
wherever you go, you know?

00:13:49.730 --> 00:13:53.350
When you're anonymous,
people might see you around town,

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:58.150
but the next day, they never say to you,
"You were over there yesterday, huh?"

00:13:59.280 --> 00:14:05.070
I'd like to see your helmet.
You know, once you finish eating.

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:17.590
Wanna try it on?

00:14:24.680 --> 00:14:26.260
Well?

00:14:36.270 --> 00:14:38.940
Are they expensive?

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:42.570
They say that the price of a helmet
is the price of keeping yourself safe,

00:14:42.570 --> 00:14:44.240
so they can be.

00:14:44.240 --> 00:14:47.830
But even so, it's about as
expensive as your helmet.

00:14:47.830 --> 00:14:49.660
Is something the matter?

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:03.840
I want to make it so it blocks the wind.

00:15:03.840 --> 00:15:06.760
Ah, a face shield. They sell those.

00:15:06.760 --> 00:15:08.220
Where?

00:15:08.220 --> 00:15:11.890
Hmm, the closest place would
have to be in Kofu, I guess.

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:13.600
Kofu...

00:15:14.730 --> 00:15:17.350
We can go and buy you one right now.

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:18.730
Huh?

00:15:26.450 --> 00:15:29.870
Oh, hang on! Let me just look
at this! I'll be done in a jiffy!

00:15:29.870 --> 00:15:32.240
I'm just going to see
if there are any for sale!

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:36.580
Oh, is that--? No, that's the wrong kind.
Ah, here they are--right here!

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:40.210
Hmm, that's a bit high.

00:15:40.210 --> 00:15:42.760
Let's see, what was it again?

00:15:42.760 --> 00:15:47.760
Oh, yeah. A face shield for your helmet.
No, I haven't forgotten!

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:57.190
Hmm, those sure are expensive.

00:15:57.190 --> 00:15:58.520
Gimme.

00:16:00.650 --> 00:16:03.530
Hmm, that's not much better.

00:16:03.530 --> 00:16:06.740
Ah, just let me check this out!

00:16:09.110 --> 00:16:13.910
It doesn't have to be that fancy.
Something a little more...

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:23.840
Excuse me...

00:16:23.840 --> 00:16:24.880
Hmm?

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:27.510
What are those you have over your eyes?

00:16:27.510 --> 00:16:30.010
Oh, safety goggles?

00:16:30.010 --> 00:16:33.060
Could I use those while
riding a motorbike?

00:16:33.060 --> 00:16:37.680
Yeah, I've seen people do that.
They're cheap, and they're tough.

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:39.770
Where do they sell them?

00:16:39.770 --> 00:16:41.940
If you want some,
they sell them at hardware stores.

00:16:41.940 --> 00:16:44.900
They have them at the Komeri
on the Koshu Highway.

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:47.740
Th-Thank you very much.

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:53.530
How about it?

00:16:53.530 --> 00:16:56.910
Sorry. I don't need one anymore.

00:16:56.990 --> 00:16:59.990
Komeri Hardware 
& Green

00:16:56.990 --> 00:16:59.990
Mukawa Store

00:19:11.380 --> 00:19:13.220
I had a dream.

00:19:14.300 --> 00:19:18.010
In my dream, I was riding my Cub, too.

00:19:37.110 --> 00:19:38.910
Good morning.

00:19:38.910 --> 00:19:40.240
Mm-hmm.

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:44.460
Hmm?

00:19:53.130 --> 00:19:56.880
My first one was a half helmet
that had been given to me,

00:19:56.880 --> 00:20:02.010
so the first time I put on a full-face
helmet, I felt the same way.

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:30.920
I'd like to ride around some more.

00:20:30.920 --> 00:20:33.420
Yeah, me, too.

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:40.970
I know!

00:20:43.140 --> 00:20:45.310
Here.

00:20:45.310 --> 00:20:50.100
That's my cellphone number.
If anything comes up, call me.

00:20:50.100 --> 00:20:51.190
Huh?

00:20:51.190 --> 00:20:53.360
Okay, be careful.

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:05.990
When I got my license,
I wasn't exactly blown away.

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:11.960
But now, after getting that slip of paper,

00:21:11.960 --> 00:21:15.050
it felt like I had earned
some kind of certificate.

00:21:17.090 --> 00:21:21.680
I don't know if we can call each other
friends; we're fellow Cub riders.

00:21:23.430 --> 00:21:29.100
That may be a relationship that
runs deeper than just friends.

00:21:35.070 --> 00:21:38.780
She told me to be careful.

00:21:39.820 --> 00:21:42.320
The words of a friend may be one thing,

00:21:42.320 --> 00:21:45.870
but I can take every last word
of a fellow Cub rider

00:21:45.870 --> 00:21:49.370
and internalize them with all sincerity.

00:21:50.750 --> 00:21:54.380
I already put her number into my cell.

00:21:54.380 --> 00:22:00.090
I may end up tossing out this note,
along with receipts from the market.

00:22:00.090 --> 00:22:03.300
But I'll never forget her words.

00:22:05.890 --> 00:22:08.060
I have no parents.

00:22:08.060 --> 00:22:10.480
No money, either.

00:22:10.480 --> 00:22:14.940
Nor do I have any hobbies,
friends, or goals for the future.

00:22:20.940 --> 00:22:22.650
But...

00:22:22.650 --> 00:22:25.740
...where I didn't have
anything in my life before...

00:22:27.330 --> 00:22:29.500
...now I have a Cub.

00:22:36.960 --> 00:22:42.340
I'm sure that my Cub and I
can go anywhere we want to.

00:24:20.980 --> 00:24:25.980
Super Cub

00:24:20.980 --> 00:24:25.980
Episode 4

00:24:20.980 --> 00:24:25.980
The Job

00:24:22.270 --> 00:24:25.860
Episode 4: "The Job."
